.TH FONTVAULT 1 "November 2026" "fontvault 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
fontvault \- back up macOS fonts, Homebrew packages, and application inventory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fontvault
.I command
[options]
.SH DESCRIPTION
fontvault classifies installed fonts, excludes macOS-managed and Homebrew-managed
font binaries, backs up personal font files, and writes Homebrew and application
inventories into a configured private Git repository.
When run without a command on a terminal, it opens an arrow-key and Vim-key
interactive menu. Subcommands remain available for scripts and automation.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init --repo PATH
Configure the private backup repository.
.TP
.B setup [--account USER] [--repo-name NAME] [--path PATH]
Guide a new Mac through dependency checks, secure GitHub CLI authentication,
private-repository access, cloning, and local configuration. Credentials are
never stored in the repository.
.TP
.B backup [--dry-run|--local|--commit|--push] [--include-shared] [--yes]
Show phase progress, compare the proposed snapshot with the previous backup,
then create the selected snapshot. Interactive use asks for confirmation unless
--yes is supplied; scheduled non-interactive backups continue automatically.
.TP
.B status
Show inventory, schedule, and Git state.
.TP
.B doctor
Validate dependencies, repository configuration, authentication, and schedule.
.TP
.B restore [fonts|homebrew|all]
Restore fonts and/or the saved Homebrew Brewfile. Existing-item conflicts are
prompted interactively; non-interactive operation keeps installed items.
.TP
.B schedule --daily HH:MM
Install the per-user daily LaunchAgent.
.TP
.B unschedule
Remove the LaunchAgent without deleting backups.
.TP
.B apps
Print the Markdown application inventory.
.TP
.B homebrew
Print the Markdown Homebrew inventory.
.TP
.B logs [--errors]
Show the latest automatic-backup log.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/fontvault/config
Per-user configuration.
.TP
.I ~/Library/Caches/fontvault/
macOS system-font fingerprint cache, keyed by OS build.
.TP
.I ~/Library/Logs/fontvault.log
Automatic-backup standard log.
.SH SAFETY
System fonts are never copied. /Library/Fonts is opt-in. A backup stops for
unresolved Git conflicts, low temporary disk space, a 100 MB font file, or a
remote branch that is ahead of local. Per-run temporary data and locks are
removed when each backup finishes, including after an interrupt.
.SH AUTHOR
Lesterwsl

